  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/orqktjl.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Particular是一款通过精心制作的视觉效果增强《我的世界》环境氛围的模组。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">加入<a href=\"https://discord.gg/m4EHeRjfZ9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Discord</a>支持我们！⚠️<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">1.20.1及之前版本需在服务端安装此模组</span>⚠️</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 已移除嵌入内容: <a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2fd76cJVT5tHs\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/d76cJVT5tHs</a> </span></span></span></p>\n\n<h2>视觉效果</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fvdrn4ouZRvQ%253ft%253d27\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">3D水花飞溅</a>\n<ul>\n<li>与水体颜色匹配</li>\n<li>实体越宽，溅起的水花范围越大</li>\n<li>跌落高度越高，水花高度越高</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1219053/description_4678497c-2509-47c8-aa19-264ab655e858.png\" width=\"731\" height=\"211\"></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>瀑布效果\n<ul>\n<li>当水流从超过2格高的水源方块落下时会产生瀑布效果，且顶部水源方块至少有一面未被遮挡</li>\n<li>瀑布强度与水流高度及水源方块开放面数量成正比</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1219053/description_37321349-afcb-445f-bf8b-97adc123e676.png\"></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>萤火虫\n<ul>\n<li>在温暖群系的花朵和草丛周围生成</li>\n<li>黄昏时随机刷新</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1219053/description_79f6f459-600e-4f0d-83ad-6d8dbbffff54.png\"></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>落叶效果\n<ul>\n<li>每个树叶方块都会产生具有独特运动轨迹的落叶粒子</li>\n<li>落入水中会产生涟漪</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1219053/description_a900b786-5bcc-46fe-8183-f8776d5da629.png\"></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>洞穴尘埃\n<ul>\n<li>生成概率与深度及阳光照射强度相关</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1219053/description_1a888eaa-9012-4c41-8528-330f073c9cdd.png\"></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>水下容器气泡\n<ul>\n<li>当水下箱子/木桶被打开时会释放气泡</li>\n<li>末影箱会释放绿色气泡</li>\n<li>在容器下方放置灵魂沙可使其自动开启并持续冒泡</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1219053/description_13325853-dcbc-4489-941b-faca3092a063.png\"></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>气泡破裂效果</li>\n<li>雨水和水滴涟漪</li>\n<li>蛋糕食用粒子</li>\n<li>发光熔岩滴落效果</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>配置选项</h2>\n<p>可禁用任意特效，并调整不生成洞穴尘埃的生物群系。</p>\n\n<h2>兼容模组</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252ftraverse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traverse</a>\n<ul>\n<li>定制落叶效果</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fregions-unexplored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regions Unexplored</a>\n<ul>\n<li>定制落叶效果</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fwilder-wild\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wilder Wild</a>\n<ul>\n<li>定制落叶效果</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>支持语言</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>加拿大英语 (Voxxin)</li>\n<li>加拿大法语 (Voxxin)</li>\n<li>简体中文 (KlainsX)</li>\n<li>欧洲法语 (Voxxin)</li>\n<li>墨西哥西班牙语 (cerealconjugo)</li>\n<li>俄语 (Alexander317)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>声明事项</h2>\n<p>本模组为<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparticular\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric版</a>的移植版本。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252feffective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Effective</a>&nbsp;是功能相似但无关的模组，支持旧版本且专为Quilt™打造，也请多多支持！</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>若您想支持我的模组开发，推荐使用BisectHosting服务。新用户输入优惠码\"project8gbderam\"可享首月服务器25%折扣。他们提供24/7全天候支持与闪电响应，为您的游戏需求提供专业保障。<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.bisecthosting.com/project8gbderam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.bisecthosting.com/project8gbderam</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/54bb107c-f9fc-4f32-8515-fb4e3d56c124.png\" alt=\"Bisect\"></p>",
